   "lines": [
    "We all three started",
    "out on foot to beat",
    "through the woods for",
    "bear; walked all day,",
    "but saw no bear. Lebo,",
    "however, started up a",
    "bull elk, which he",
    "fired at and missed;",
    "it ran across my",
    "way and stood",
    "behind some trees; I",
    "could only see part",
    "of its flank, which",
    "I fired into; away",
    "it started, and, running",
    "at top speed in my",
    "light moccasins, I",
    "got another shot",
    "and broke his",
    "back."
   ],
